  "comment": "Query matrix for job_scraper/pipeline.py. Each cli_query runs `bun run .agents/skills/<portal>/cli/src/cli.ts <args>`. Edit queries here, not in the pipeline. Portal must match a directory under .agents/skills/. Target families searched on purpose: entry full-stack and AI engineering; Sales Engineer / Solutions Engineer (including associate and junior seats); Technical Sales Representative / Technical Sales Consultant; Pre-Sales Consultant / Solutions Consultant / Solutions Architect. Customer engineer, implementation and technical account manager are searched only as adjacent roles and score medium at most. QA is not searched. LinkedIn is read up to 5 pages of 10 results. --jobage is snapped to LinkedIn's valid windows of 1, 7, 14, or 30 days. It is not capped at 20 results.",
